  "behavior": [
    "referencePlacementRoot consumes ordinary nonactor position, all three Euler angles and reference scale; constructs original axis matrices and all three successive products including the initial identity multiplication. Default Single models live007F; optional Double retains027F intermediates. Translation is copied exactly and reference scale becomes absolute after matrix construction.",
    "Unknown precision, nonfinite consumed fields and each axis outside the native FSINCOS finite argument domain |angle|<2^63 reject without mutation. Zero/subnormal/negative scales are arithmetic inputs here; this does not widen live physical admission.",
    "Existing NPC placement now uses the same internal placementSinCos implementation moved unchanged into placementsincos.hpp. It retains the66-bit x87 pi reduction and existing yaw-only/morphology behavior. Native comparison covers the refactor.",
    "Two new tests pin10 literal native hardware vectors across both supported precision modes, large/subnormal/signed-zero inputs, exact translation/scale and default-live behavior; malformed fields and range boundaries reject. No ObjectAnimation/World call is changed."
  ],
